Software obtained at container-image build time or at run time (not included
in this repository):

  tt-kmd (https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-kmd)          GPL-2.0
    The Tenstorrent kernel-mode driver. The builder image clones and compiles
    tt-kmd on the target node at run time and installs its udev rules file
    on the host from that checkout; no tt-kmd source is included in this
    repository or in the published container images.
  tt-smi (https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-smi)          Apache-2.0
    Prebuilt release binaries are downloaded into the builder and flasher images.
  tt-flash (https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-flash)      Apache-2.0
    Installed into the flasher image.
  tt-system-firmware (https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-system-firmware)  Apache-2.0
    Firmware bundles are downloaded by the flasher Job at run time.

